gest, the in-process bus, Manim rendering and the LRS sweeper. Two slots share one plan and one App Insights." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6773;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="95" y="690" width="770" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cur-cae" value="Container Apps env cae-yuvi-720 · consumption, no vnet" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#F4F9FE;strokeColor=#3D8BD4;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontSize=12;fontColor=#12456E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="535" width="840" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cur-ggd" value="ca-game-gen-dev&lt;br&gt;KEDA · 1–2" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;fontColor=#26343F;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/other/Worker_Container_App.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="588" width="52" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cur-ggp" value="ca-game-gen-prod&lt;br&gt;KEDA · 1–10" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;fontColor=#26343F;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/other/Worker_Container_App.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="588" width="52" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cur-ggid" value="id-game-gen&lt;br&gt;dev + prod" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;fontColor=#26343F;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Managed_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1450" y="588" width="52" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cur-16" value="The one piece already event-driven: Game Lab pulls sessions off Service Bus and scales on queue depth. The template the rest should follow." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;al